00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:19.459 line:92%
would be surprised to hear

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:22.929
the effect that it has on th
person they are speaking to.

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:23.830 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Definitely.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that I think is one of th
helpful things as a way --

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:27.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
Basically through this tim
we're living in,

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.869 size:84% position:42%
it's, like, more people
have to be thoughtful

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:30.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
of, like,
how this is being heard

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:33.906
