thought of as you're saying it

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:38.044
-Yeah. People aren't willing
to look at the effect it has

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:40.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're only willing
to look at, like,

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:43.216 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
